{"detail": {"templateUuid": "fab53e3633e149b28473a41bc0ae520e", "projectUuid": "9506221761b04bb1b959a6b9b4c65dc9", "name": "叩苍天", "description": "这次创作最大的初衷，就是想用全新的视觉方式，重新诠释秦腔非遗文化，让古老的乡音被更多人看见。长大之后才慢慢懂得，秦腔从来不止是一项冰冷的非遗传承，更是我们这一代人的专属回忆声仓。每一段唱腔里，都藏着记忆的陪伴，藏着纯粹的旧时光，藏着独一无二的乡愁。\n所以想用AI影像赋能传统文化，跳出刻板的舞台视角，完整展现秦腔演员光鲜的台前演绎，也记录他们不为人知的幕后坚守与付出。以新貌传古韵，用这部短片，致敬非遗秦腔，也致敬藏在岁月里的思念与童年！", "coverUrl": "/assets/719599128aaa9b92.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/cb00e901705c4b43acd77a04f090481c/e1ce3cbd8b4bf8ba1faa4781fbaecd89475a305d.mp4", "snapshotId": 22853, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 829172, "ownerUuid": "cb00e901705c4b43acd77a04f090481c", "avatar": "/assets/50f942cbb80b3dda.webp", "nickname": "Dillan同学", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 15, "tags": [{"id": 3036, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI漫剧精卫计划", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3036/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3038, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2-国风非遗专项", "parentTag": 3036, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3036/3038", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1202, "code": "style_aesthetic", "tagLabel": "风格美学", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1202/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "Ai短片《叩苍天》 这次创作最大的初衷，就是想用全新... http://xhslink.com/o/6VtBW8CMKVE  直达【小红书】探索笔记全文~", "createAt": "2026年06月29日 21:01", "updateAt": "2026年07月03日 00:28", "publishAt": "2026年06月29日 21:01", "playCount": 6, "viewCreationProcessCount": 1, "copyCanvasCount": 1, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/fab53e3633e149b28473a41bc0ae520e.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 514, "edges": 425}}, "recommendList": []}